    "media:imagetext": "VARIG\nTIMETABLE\n08/88\nIf you are someone\nwho appreciates friendliness\nand a desire to please,\nyou should be flying with us.\nFor us, friendliness\ncomes naturally. We're\nfirst and foremost a\nBrazilian airline. And, as\nyou probably know\nBrazilians are good-\nhumoured people, with\na style all their own.\nYou'll be able to\nsample this friendliness\nand desire to please,\nwhen our crews help\nyou to enjoy one of the\nest inflight services in\nthe world.\nWhen you are facing\na loug flight, it's only fair\nthat you should be able\nto enjoy the pleasure of\nagreeable companv.\nTry flying with Varig,\nthe airline that is\nknown worldwide for\nits friendliness and\nefficiency.\nTime to\nfly e\nVARIG\nExpresão",
